&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Genel Başkanımız&amp;nbsp;Mahmut Arıkan, Kamu G&amp;ouml;revlileri Hakem Kurulu&amp;rsquo;nun memur ve memur emeklilerine y&amp;ouml;nelik maaş zammı kararına sert tepki g&amp;ouml;sterdi.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Memur ve emekliye zam adı altında sefalet &amp;uuml;cretinin reva g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ld&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; belirterek, &amp;ldquo;Enflasyonun en iyimser rakamlarla bile y&amp;uuml;zde 30&amp;rsquo;larda olduğu bir &amp;uuml;lkede, memura &amp;lsquo;tek haneli&amp;rsquo; zam teklif edildiğini g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;k. Sormak istiyorum: Vergi zammı tek haneli mi? Elektrik zammı tek haneli mi? Doğalgaz zammı tek haneli mi?&amp;rdquo; diye sordu.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;FUTBOL TABİRİYLE &amp;lsquo;VAR&amp;rsquo;A G&amp;Ouml;T&amp;Uuml;R&amp;Uuml;LMELİDİR!&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Buradan Hakem Heyeti&amp;rsquo;ne ve onların vicdanına sesleniyorum!&amp;rdquo; diyen Arıkan, ş&amp;ouml;yle devam etti: &amp;ldquo;Futbolda bir tabir vardır, Var&amp;rsquo;a g&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;rmek diye. Ben de diyorum ki, bu pozisyon tartışmalıdır! Hakem heyeti bunu &amp;lsquo;Var&amp;rsquo;a g&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;rmeli&amp;rsquo;dir. Peki, Bu &amp;lsquo;Var&amp;rsquo;da&amp;rsquo; ne var? 26 bin TL olan a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırı var. 90 bin TL olan yoksulluk sınırı var. Ortalama 30 bin TL olan kira var. &amp;Ccedil;ocukların okul masrafları var. Faturalar, &amp;ouml;demeler, bor&amp;ccedil; var, har&amp;ccedil; var.&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;MEMURUNA HAKKETTİĞİ ZAMMI YAPACAK BİR İKTİDARI YOK!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Vatandaşa seslenerek h&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;mete tepkisini s&amp;uuml;rd&amp;uuml;ren Arıkan, &amp;ldquo;Halbuki bu memleketin kaynakları var, imkanları var. Fakat memuruna hakkettiği zammı yapacak bir iktidarı yok!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ancak yılmak da yok! Biz, Saadet Partisi olarak, T&amp;uuml;rkiye B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k Millet Meclisi&amp;rsquo;nde&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;memurumuzun hakkını savunmak i&amp;ccedil;in b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n gayretimizi ortaya koyacağız. Bu milletin varı yoğu Meclis&amp;rsquo;tir&amp;rdquo; dedi.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
